OL,3,GNEWSADrivers face six weeks of city
OL,4,Aring road delays
OL,5,
OL,6,FLane closures and other temporary
OL,7,Ftraffic restrictions are set to take
OL,8,Fplace on Wolverhampton's ring road for
OL,9,Fnearly six weeks.
OL,11,FIt is part of work by National Grid to
OL,12,Fimprove infrastructure and will take
OL,13,Fplace in phases on sections of Ring
OL,14,FRoad St Patrick's and Ring Road St
OL,15,FDavid's, said the city council.
OL,17,FThe measures from Tuesday until Sunday
OL,18,F4 October include occasional road
OL,19,Fclosures affecting traffic through the
OL,20,FBroad Street junction.
OL,23,APub: 31-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
